<title>USA: Calcomp names Kodak exec as president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Calcomp names Kodak exec as president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>CalComp Technology Inc dsaid Wednesday it had named John Batterton as president, chief executive officer and a director, effective April 1.</p>
<p>Batterton succeeds Gary Long, who retired in February.</p>
<p>John Millerick, senior vice president and chief financial officer, had been serving as acting president and CEO since Long's retirement.</p>
<p>Since 1994 Batterton has been Eastman Kodak Co's general manager and vice president of operations at its business imaging systems division.</p>
</text>
